        +isValidAt(Instant) boolean
    }

    KnowledgeItem --> KnowledgeProvenance
    KnowledgeItem --> KnowledgeAuthority
    KnowledgeItem --> KnowledgeValidity
```

### 4.7.2 The Retrieval Pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Q[KnowledgeQuery] --> REG[KnowledgeRegistry]
    REG -->|resolve sources| SRC[KnowledgeSource list]
    SRC -->|parallel query| RES[KnowledgeResult list]
    RES --> DEDUP[Deduplicate by item.id]
    DEDUP --> RANK[Rank by score + authority]
    RANK --> BUDGET[Apply KnowledgeBudget]
    BUDGET --> SEL[KnowledgeSelectionResult]
    SEL --> CTX[Context assembly]

