    KS-->>KR: KnowledgeResult(evidence)
    KR->>KR: deduplicate + rank
    KR-->>A: KnowledgeResult

    A->>SEL: select(candidates, budget, context)
    SEL->>SEL: filter validity, provenance, score
    SEL->>SEL: apply source/authority quotas
    SEL-->>A: KnowledgeSelectionResult(selected)

    A->>FUS: fuse(federationResults, query)
